            "required": 0,
            "conditional_logic": 0,
            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "The story of Teatr DGU continues. We preserve archival recordings in the Digital Museum and create new productions. Your support helps us preserve the theatre’s history and develop new work.\n\nDonations to support the theatre are collected by our partner, the Cultural Capital International Charitable Foundation. Thank you to everyone who supports the theatre in Ukraine and abroad.",
